    "content": "### Tell us what your team needs to build.\n\nEvaluating BuildNinja, planning a rollout, or choosing an edition? Share your workflow and the questions you want to answer.\n\nAlready using BuildNinja and need technical help? [Contact support](https://www.buildninja.io/support).\n\n### Start a conversation.\n\n| Field | Label or helper copy |\n| --- | --- |\n| Full name | Your full name |\n| Work email | Where we should reply |\n| Subject | What would you like to discuss? |\n| Details | Tell us about your team, current CI/CD setup, and what you want to achieve. |\n\n**Submit action:** Send message  \n**Submitting:** Sending your message…  \n**Validation — name:** Enter your name.  \n**Validation — email:** Enter a valid email address.  \n**Validation — subject:** Add a subject.  \n**Validation — details:** Tell us how we can help.  \n**Success:** Thanks. Your message has been received. We will reply using the email address you provided.  \n**Error:** Your message could not be sent. Please try again or email our team.\n\n### Prefer email?\n\n[buildninja@grapecity.global](mailto:buildninja@grapecity.global)\n\n### Our office.\n\nGrapeCity India Pvt. Ltd.  \nA-15, Sector 62  \nNoida, Uttar Pradesh 201307  \nIndia\n\n**Phone:** +91 120 247 0123  \n**Map action:** View office location\n\n### Explore while we connect.\n\n[Try the live sandbox](https://www.buildninja.io/dojo) · [Compare editions and credits](https://www.buildninja.io/pricing) · [Read the documentation](https://www.buildninja.io/docs/overview)"
