    "content": "### Let's get you back to your build.\n\nTell us what you are trying to do, what happened, and where you need help.\n\n[Read the documentation](https://www.buildninja.io/docs/overview) · [Search FAQs](https://www.buildninja.io/faq)\n\n### Find a useful starting point.\n\n| Need help with | Start here |\n| --- | --- |\n| Installation and first setup | [Quick setup guides](https://www.buildninja.io/docs/category/quick-setup-guide) |\n| Activation and licensing | [Licensing documentation](https://www.buildninja.io/docs/category/licensing) |\n| Product behavior and workflows | [Documentation](https://www.buildninja.io/docs/overview) |\n| AI credits and top-ups | [Pricing FAQs](https://www.buildninja.io/pricing) |\n| Changes in a release | [Release notes](https://www.buildninja.io/docs/category/release-notes) |\n\n### Send a support request.\n\n| Field | Label or helper copy |\n| --- | --- |\n| Full name | Your full name |\n| Work email | Where we should reply |\n| Subject | A short description of the issue |\n| Details | Include your BuildNinja version, operating system, affected workflow, what you expected, and what happened. |\n\nRelevant error text helps us understand the issue. Remove passwords, tokens, and other sensitive information before sharing it.\n\n**Submit action:** Send support request  \n**Submitting:** Sending your request…  \n**Validation — name:** Enter your name.  \n**Validation — email:** Enter a valid email address.  \n**Validation — subject:** Add a short description of the issue.  \n**Validation — details:** Describe the problem so we can help.  \n**Verification message:** Complete the verification to send your request.  \n**Success:** Your support request has been received. We will reply using the email address you provided.  \n**Error:** Your request could not be sent. Try again or email buildninja@grapecity.global.\n\n### Prefer to email us?\n\n[buildninja@grapecity.global](mailto:buildninja@grapecity.global)\n\n### Still evaluating BuildNinja?\n\nIf your question is about product fit, a demo, or choosing an edition, [talk to our team](https://www.buildninja.io/contact)."
